        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(2x+1)(x+3)$",
          "worked": "The cross terms are $6x+x=7x$, and $1\\times3=3$.\n$$2x^2+7x+3=(2x+1)(x+3).$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p31-q15-root",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$$3x^2-11x-4$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(3x+1)(x-4)$",
          "worked": "The cross terms are $-12x+x=-11x$, and $1(-4)=-4$.\n$$3x^2-11x-4=(3x+1)(x-4).$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p31-q16-root",
