        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(5x-3)(x-2)$",
          "worked": "The cross terms are $-10x-3x=-13x$, and $(-3)(-2)=6$.\n$$5x^2-13x+6=(5x-3)(x-2).$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
